message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="fd0d7f05-3fff-44a0-a074-327c64fcf96a" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="LR5Y_W_content markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling"><p dir="auto" data-start="0" data-end="147">Perfect. 💙 Since you want <strong data-start="27" data-end="78">something genuinely different from the last one</strong>, this version is more like an interactive mini-story for <strong data-start="136" data-end="146">Yuvraj</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="149" data-end="517">
<li data-section-id="dn7oh0" data-start="149" data-end="184">
<p dir="auto" data-start="151" data-end="184">🌙 Dark blue/purple premium theme</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="2okay2" data-start="185" data-end="221">
<p dir="auto" data-start="187" data-end="221">💌 “Open your surprise” experience</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1crk2j" data-start="222" data-end="255">
<p dir="auto" data-start="224" data-end="255">🎁 Multiple clickable surprises</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="o7ff5g" data-start="256" data-end="299">
<p dir="auto" data-start="258" data-end="299">🫶 A “reasons why you’re special” section</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="joq9ij" data-start="300" data-end="345">
<p dir="auto" data-start="302" data-end="345">🎵 Music button (you can add your own song)</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="gugipt" data-start="346" data-end="371">
<p dir="auto" data-start="348" data-end="371">✨ Floating stars/hearts</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1qxle4a" data-start="372" data-end="395">
<p dir="auto" data-start="374" data-end="395">📸 No photos required</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1pjethl" data-start="396" data-end="448">
<p dir="auto" data-start="398" data-end="448">💙 Ends with a special <strong data-start="421" data-end="448">Boyfriend’s Day message</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="cqktjz" data-start="449" data-end="472">
<p dir="auto" data-start="451" data-end="472">📱 Works on phone too</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="im0m9n" data-start="473" data-end="517">
<p dir="auto" data-start="475" data-end="517">Everything is in <strong data-start="492" data-end="517">one <code data-start="498" data-end="510">index.html</code> file</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="hwcza0" dir="auto" data-start="519" data-end="551"><span role="text">Step 1 — Create <code data-start="539" data-end="551">index.html</code></span></h3>
<p dir="auto" data-start="553" data-end="618">Delete whatever old code is there and paste this <strong data-start="602" data-end="617">entire code</strong>:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="620" data-end="11701"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="relative h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="select-none sticky z-2 top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-(--code-block-surface)"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6bbe06e6.svg#fa6359" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>HTML</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><div role="group" aria-label="Code block view" class="group/code-block-preview-toggle relative flex items-center gap-0.5"><div aria-hidden="true" class="bg-token-interactive-bg-secondary-press pointer-events-none absolute start-0 top-0 size-9 rounded-full motion-safe:transition-transform motion-safe:duration-200 motion-safe:ease-in-out translate-x-0 group-has-[[data-code-block-preview-toggle-preview]:hover]/code-block-preview-toggle:translate-x-[calc(100%+2px)] group-has-[[data-code-block-preview-toggle-preview]:focus-visible]/code-block-preview-toggle:translate-x-[calc(100%+2px)]"></div><span class="" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-label="Code" aria-pressed="true" class="relative z-1 flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full motion-safe:transition-colors text-token-text-primary" data-code-block-preview-toggle-code="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6bbe06e6.svg#72c6a7" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span><span class="" data-state="closed"><button type="button" aria-label="Preview" aria-pressed="false" aria-disabled="false" class="relative z-1 flex size-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full motion-safe:transition-colors text-token-text-primary" data-code-block-preview-toggle-preview="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6bbe06e6.svg#6ef7a4" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></div><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6bbe06e6.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div data-custom-highlighting-behavior="boundary" class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class=""><div class="relative [container-type:inline-size]"><div class="w-full overflow-x-hidden overflow-y-auto" style="max-height: 56.25cqw; transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span class="ͼf">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;html</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">lang</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"en"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;head&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;meta</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">charset</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"UTF-8"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;meta</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">name</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"viewport"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">content</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;title&gt;</span><span>For Yuvraj 💙</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/title&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;style&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼg">*</span><span>{
    margin:</span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span>;
    padding:</span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span>;
    box-sizing:</span><span class="ͼj">border-box</span><span>;
    font-family: </span><span class="ͼk">"Poppins"</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼj">Arial</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼj">sans-serif</span><span>;
}

</span><span class="ͼo">html</span><span>{
    scroll-behavior:</span><span class="ͼj">smooth</span><span>;
}

</span><span class="ͼo">body</span><span>{
    background:#070b1c;
    color:</span><span class="ͼj">white</span><span>;
    overflow-x:</span><span class="ͼj">hidden</span><span>;
}

</span><span class="ͼe">/* BACKGROUND */</span><span>

.</span><span class="ͼl">stars</span><span>{
    position:</span><span class="ͼj">fixed</span><span>;
    inset:</span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span>;
    z-index:</span><span class="ͼj">-2</span><span>;
    overflow:</span><span class="ͼj">hidden</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼl">star</span><span>{
    position:</span><span class="ͼj">absolute</span><span>;
    width:</span><span class="ͼj">3</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    height:</span><span class="ͼj">3</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    background:</span><span class="ͼj">white</span><span>;
    border-radius:</span><span class="ͼj">50</span><span class="ͼg">%</span><span>;
    animation:</span><span class="ͼj">twinkle</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">2</span><span class="ͼg">s</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">infinite</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">alternate</span><span>;
}

</span><span class="ͼg">@keyframes</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">twinkle</span><span>{
    </span><span class="ͼg">from</span><span>{opacity:</span><span class="ͼj">.2</span><span>; transform:</span><span class="ͼg">scale</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">.7</span><span>);}
    </span><span class="ͼg">to</span><span>{opacity:</span><span class="ͼj">1</span><span>; transform:</span><span class="ͼg">scale</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">1.4</span><span>);}
}

</span><span class="ͼe">/* HERO */</span><span>

.</span><span class="ͼl">hero</span><span>{
    min-height:</span><span class="ͼj">100</span><span class="ͼg">vh</span><span>;
    display:</span><span class="ͼj">flex</span><span>;
    justify-content:</span><span class="ͼj">center</span><span>;
    align-items:</span><span class="ͼj">center</span><span>;
    text-align:</span><span class="ͼj">center</span><span>;
    padding:</span><span class="ͼj">30</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    position:</span><span class="ͼj">relative</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼl">hero-content</span><span>{
    max-width:</span><span class="ͼj">800</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼl">small</span><span>{
    color:#8ea7ff;
    letter-spacing:</span><span class="ͼj">4</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    text-transform:</span><span class="ͼj">uppercase</span><span>;
    font-size:</span><span class="ͼj">13</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    margin-bottom:</span><span class="ͼj">20</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
}

</span><span class="ͼo">h1</span><span>{
    font-size:</span><span class="ͼg">clamp</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">55</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">10</span><span class="ͼg">vw</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">110</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>);
    line-height:</span><span class="ͼj">.9</span><span>;
    background:</span><span class="ͼg">linear-gradient</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">90</span><span class="ͼg">deg</span><span>,#fff,#91a8ff,#d3b5ff);
    -webkit-background-clip:</span><span class="ͼj">text</span><span>;
    color:</span><span class="ͼj">transparent</span><span>;
    margin-bottom:</span><span class="ͼj">25</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼl">hero</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">p</span><span>{
    font-size:</span><span class="ͼj">18</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    color:#c6c9dc;
    line-height:</span><span class="ͼj">1.7</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼl">open-btn</span><span>{
    margin-top:</span><span class="ͼj">35</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    padding:</span><span class="ͼj">15</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">32</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    border:</span><span class="ͼj">none</span><span>;
    border-radius:</span><span class="ͼj">50</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    background:</span><span class="ͼg">linear-gradient</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">135</span><span class="ͼg">deg</span><span>,#667eea,#8e54e9);
    color:</span><span class="ͼj">white</span><span>;
    font-size:</span><span class="ͼj">16</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    cursor:</span><span class="ͼj">pointer</span><span>;
    box-shadow:</span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">30</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼg">rgba</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">115</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">108</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">.4</span><span>);
    transition:</span><span class="ͼj">.3</span><span class="ͼg">s</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼl">open-btn</span><span>:</span><span class="ͼl">hover</span><span>{
    transform:</span><span class="ͼg">translateY</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">-4</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>) </span><span class="ͼg">scale</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">1.03</span><span>);
    box-shadow:</span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">45</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼg">rgba</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">115</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">108</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">.7</span><span>);
}

</span><span class="ͼe">/* SECTIONS */</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">section</span><span>{
    min-height:</span><span class="ͼj">100</span><span class="ͼg">vh</span><span>;
    padding:</span><span class="ͼj">100</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">25</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    display:</span><span class="ͼj">flex</span><span>;
    align-items:</span><span class="ͼj">center</span><span>;
    justify-content:</span><span class="ͼj">center</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼl">container</span><span>{
    width:</span><span class="ͼj">100</span><span class="ͼg">%</span><span>;
    max-width:</span><span class="ͼj">1000</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    text-align:</span><span class="ͼj">center</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼl">section-title</span><span>{
    font-size:</span><span class="ͼj">45</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    margin-bottom:</span><span class="ͼj">20</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼl">section-subtitle</span><span>{
    color:#aeb4ce;
    margin-bottom:</span><span class="ͼj">50</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
}

</span><span class="ͼe">/* CARD */</span><span>

.</span><span class="ͼl">card</span><span>{
    background:</span><span class="ͼg">rgba</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">.06</span><span>);
    border:</span><span class="ͼj">1</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">solid</span><span> </span><span class="ͼg">rgba</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">.1</span><span>);
    backdrop-filter:</span><span class="ͼg">blur</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">15</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>);
    border-radius:</span><span class="ͼj">25</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    padding:</span><span class="ͼj">40</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    box-shadow:</span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">20</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">60</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼg">rgba</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">.3</span><span>);
}

</span><span class="ͼe">/* MESSAGE */</span><span>

.</span><span class="ͼl">message</span><span>{
    font-size:</span><span class="ͼj">19</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    line-height:</span><span class="ͼj">2</span><span>;
    color:#d9dced;
}

.</span><span class="ͼl">message</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">span</span><span>{
    color:#9eaeff;
    font-weight:</span><span class="ͼj">bold</span><span>;
}

</span><span class="ͼe">/* REASONS */</span><span>

.</span><span class="ͼl">reasons</span><span>{
    display:</span><span class="ͼj">grid</span><span>;
    grid-template-columns:</span><span class="ͼg">repeat</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">3</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">1</span><span class="ͼg">fr</span><span>);
    gap:</span><span class="ͼj">20</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼl">reason</span><span>{
    padding:</span><span class="ͼj">30</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">20</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    border-radius:</span><span class="ͼj">20</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    background:</span><span class="ͼg">rgba</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">.05</span><span>);
    border:</span><span class="ͼj">1</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">solid</span><span> </span><span class="ͼg">rgba</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">.08</span><span>);
    transition:</span><span class="ͼj">.3</span><span class="ͼg">s</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼl">reason</span><span>:</span><span class="ͼl">hover</span><span>{
    transform:</span><span class="ͼg">translateY</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">-8</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>);
    background:</span><span class="ͼg">rgba</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">120</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">120</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">255</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">.1</span><span>);
}

.</span><span class="ͼl">reason</span><span> .</span><span class="ͼl">icon</span><span>{
    font-size:</span><span class="ͼj">40</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    margin-bottom:</span><span class="ͼj">15</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼl">reason</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">h3</span><span>{
    margin-bottom:</span><span class="ͼj">10</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼl">reason</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">p</span><span>{
    color:#aeb4ce;
    line-height:</span><span class="ͼj">1.6</span><span>;
}

</span><span class="ͼe">/* GAME */</span><span>

.</span><span class="ͼl">question</span><span>{
    font-size:</span><span class="ͼj">28</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    margin-bottom:</span><span class="ͼj">30</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼl">choice</span><span>{
    display:</span><span class="ͼj">flex</span><span>;
    justify-content:</span><span class="ͼj">center</span><span>;
    gap:</span><span class="ͼj">15</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    flex-wrap:</span><span class="ͼj">wrap</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼl">choice</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">button</span><span>{
    padding:</span><span class="ͼj">13</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">25</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    border-radius:</span><span class="ͼj">30</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    border:</span><span class="ͼj">1</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">solid</span><span> #6979d9;
    background:</span><span class="ͼj">transparent</span><span>;
    color:</span><span class="ͼj">white</span><span>;
    cursor:</span><span class="ͼj">pointer</span><span>;
    transition:</span><span class="ͼj">.3</span><span class="ͼg">s</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼl">choice</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">button</span><span>:</span><span class="ͼl">hover</span><span>{
    background:#6979d9;
}

</span><span class="ͼe">/* SURPRISE */</span><span>

.</span><span class="ͼl">surprise-box</span><span>{
    min-height:</span><span class="ͼj">250</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    display:</span><span class="ͼj">flex</span><span>;
    justify-content:</span><span class="ͼj">center</span><span>;
    align-items:</span><span class="ͼj">center</span><span>;
    flex-direction:</span><span class="ͼj">column</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼl">gift</span><span>{
    font-size:</span><span class="ͼj">90</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    cursor:</span><span class="ͼj">pointer</span><span>;
    transition:</span><span class="ͼj">.4</span><span class="ͼg">s</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼl">gift</span><span>:</span><span class="ͼl">hover</span><span>{
    transform:</span><span class="ͼg">scale</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">1.15</span><span>) </span><span class="ͼg">rotate</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">5</span><span class="ͼg">deg</span><span>);
}

.</span><span class="ͼl">hidden-message</span><span>{
    display:</span><span class="ͼj">none</span><span>;
    margin-top:</span><span class="ͼj">25</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    font-size:</span><span class="ͼj">20</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    line-height:</span><span class="ͼj">1.8</span><span>;
    color:#d8dcff;
}

</span><span class="ͼe">/* FINAL */</span><span>

.</span><span class="ͼl">final</span><span>{
    text-align:</span><span class="ͼj">center</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼl">final</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">h2</span><span>{
    font-size:</span><span class="ͼg">clamp</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">45</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">8</span><span class="ͼg">vw</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼj">85</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>);
    background:</span><span class="ͼg">linear-gradient</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">90</span><span class="ͼg">deg</span><span>,#8297ff,#d49aff);
    -webkit-background-clip:</span><span class="ͼj">text</span><span>;
    color:</span><span class="ͼj">transparent</span><span>;
}

.</span><span class="ͼl">final</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">p</span><span>{
    max-width:</span><span class="ͼj">650</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    margin:</span><span class="ͼj">25</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">auto</span><span>;
    color:#c2c6db;
    font-size:</span><span class="ͼj">18</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    line-height:</span><span class="ͼj">1.9</span><span>;
}

</span><span class="ͼe">/* MUSIC BUTTON */</span><span>

.</span><span class="ͼl">music</span><span>{
    position:</span><span class="ͼj">fixed</span><span>;
    right:</span><span class="ͼj">20</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    bottom:</span><span class="ͼj">20</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    width:</span><span class="ͼj">50</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    height:</span><span class="ͼj">50</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    border-radius:</span><span class="ͼj">50</span><span class="ͼg">%</span><span>;
    border:</span><span class="ͼj">none</span><span>;
    background:#667eea;
    color:</span><span class="ͼj">white</span><span>;
    cursor:</span><span class="ͼj">pointer</span><span>;
    font-size:</span><span class="ͼj">20</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    z-index:</span><span class="ͼj">20</span><span>;
}

</span><span class="ͼe">/* FLOATING HEARTS */</span><span>

.</span><span class="ͼl">heart</span><span>{
    position:</span><span class="ͼj">fixed</span><span>;
    bottom:</span><span class="ͼj">-30</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    animation:</span><span class="ͼj">floatUp</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">5</span><span class="ͼg">s</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">linear</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">forwards</span><span>;
    pointer-events:</span><span class="ͼj">none</span><span>;
    z-index:</span><span class="ͼj">10</span><span>;
}

</span><span class="ͼg">@keyframes</span><span> </span><span class="ͼo">floatUp</span><span>{
    </span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span class="ͼg">%</span><span>{
        transform:</span><span class="ͼg">translateY</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span>) </span><span class="ͼg">scale</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">.8</span><span>);
        opacity:</span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span>;
    }
    </span><span class="ͼj">15</span><span class="ͼg">%</span><span>{opacity:</span><span class="ͼj">1</span><span>;}
    </span><span class="ͼj">100</span><span class="ͼg">%</span><span>{
        transform:</span><span class="ͼg">translateY</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">-110</span><span class="ͼg">vh</span><span>) </span><span class="ͼg">rotate</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">30</span><span class="ͼg">deg</span><span>);
        opacity:</span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span>;
    }
}

</span><span class="ͼe">/* RESPONSIVE */</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼg">@media</span><span>(max-width:</span><span class="ͼj">700</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>){

    </span><span class="ͼo">section</span><span>{
        padding:</span><span class="ͼj">80</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span> </span><span class="ͼj">18</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    }

    .</span><span class="ͼl">card</span><span>{
        padding:</span><span class="ͼj">25</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    }

    .</span><span class="ͼl">reasons</span><span>{
        grid-template-columns:</span><span class="ͼj">1</span><span class="ͼg">fr</span><span>;
    }

    .</span><span class="ͼl">section-title</span><span>{
        font-size:</span><span class="ͼj">36</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    }

    .</span><span class="ͼl">message</span><span>{
        font-size:</span><span class="ͼj">16</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;
    }
}
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/style&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/head&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;body&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"stars"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">id</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"stars"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼe">&lt;!-- HERO --&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;section</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"hero"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"hero-content"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"small"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>A little something for</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;h1&gt;</span><span>Yuvraj.</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/h1&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;p&gt;</span><span>
Not a normal website.</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;br&gt;</span><span>
Not a normal message.</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;br&gt;</span><span>
Just a tiny digital world made especially for you.
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;button</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"open-btn"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">onclick</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"</span><span class="ͼm">startExperience</span><span>()</span><span class="ͼk">"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>
Open Your Surprise ✨
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/button&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/section&gt;</span><span>


</span><span class="ͼe">&lt;!-- MESSAGE --&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;section</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">id</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"message"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"container"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"small"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>Chapter 01</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;h2</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"section-title"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>If I had to describe you...</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/h2&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"card"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;p</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"message"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>

I'd probably run out of words first. 🤍

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</span><span>

You're one of those people who somehow became
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;strong&gt;</span><span>more important than you were supposed to.</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/strong&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</span><span>

And somewhere between the conversations,
the stupid jokes, the little arguments,
the random moments and everything in between...

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</span><span>

you became someone I genuinely don't want
to imagine my days without.

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</span><span>

So this isn't just a </span><span class="ͼo">&lt;span&gt;</span><span>"Happy Boyfriend's Day"</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/span&gt;</span><span> message.

It's my little reminder that
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;span&gt;</span><span>I'm really happy you're you.</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/span&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/section&gt;</span><span>


</span><span class="ͼe">&lt;!-- REASONS --&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;section&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"container"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"small"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>Chapter 02</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;h2</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"section-title"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>Things I secretly love about you</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/h2&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;p</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"section-subtitle"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>
And no, you're not allowed to argue with these.
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"reasons"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"reason"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"icon"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>🎤</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;h3&gt;</span><span>Your Voice</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/h3&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;p&gt;</span><span>
Especially when you sing.
You probably don't realise how cute it is.
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"reason"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"icon"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>👀</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;h3&gt;</span><span>Your Eyes</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/h3&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;p&gt;</span><span>
There is something about the way you look at me
that I can't properly explain.
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"reason"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"icon"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>🫶</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;h3&gt;</span><span>Your Way</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/h3&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;p&gt;</span><span>
The little things you do without even thinking
are sometimes my favourite things.
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"reason"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"icon"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>😂</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;h3&gt;</span><span>Your Chaos</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/h3&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;p&gt;</span><span>
Because apparently peace and quiet were never
part of the plan with you.
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"reason"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"icon"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>🌙</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;h3&gt;</span><span>Your Presence</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/h3&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;p&gt;</span><span>
Even an ordinary day feels a little different
when you're around.
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"reason"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"icon"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>💙</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;h3&gt;</span><span>Just You</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/h3&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;p&gt;</span><span>
Honestly, the biggest reason is simply...
you're Yuvraj.
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/section&gt;</span><span>


</span><span class="ͼe">&lt;!-- QUESTION --&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;section&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"container"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"small"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>Chapter 03</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;h2</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"section-title"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>One very important question.</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/h2&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"card"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"question"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>
Would you choose me again? 🥺
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"choice"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;button</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">onclick</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"</span><span class="ͼm">answerYes</span><span>()</span><span class="ͼk">"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>Obviously. 💙</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/button&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;button</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">onclick</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"</span><span class="ͼm">answerYes</span><span>()</span><span class="ͼk">"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>Always. 🫶</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/button&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;p</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">id</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"answer"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">style</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"</span><span>margin-top:</span><span class="ͼj">30</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;color:#aebaff;</span><span class="ͼk">"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/section&gt;</span><span>


</span><span class="ͼe">&lt;!-- GIFT --&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;section&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"container"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"small"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>Chapter 04</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;h2</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"section-title"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>There's one last thing...</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/h2&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;p</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"section-subtitle"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>
You have to open it yourself.
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"card surprise-box"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"gift"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">onclick</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"</span><span class="ͼm">openGift</span><span>()</span><span class="ͼk">"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>
🎁
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;p</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">id</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"giftMessage"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"hidden-message"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>

Okay Yuvraj...

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</span><span>

If this entire website could give you one thing,
it would be this:

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;strong&gt;</span><span>
A reminder that somewhere in this huge world,
there is someone who is genuinely happy
that you exist.
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/strong&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</span><span>

And yes...

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;br&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;span</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">style</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"</span><span>font-size:</span><span class="ͼj">28</span><span class="ͼg">px</span><span>;</span><span class="ͼk">"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>I love youuuu. 💙</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/span&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/section&gt;</span><span>


</span><span class="ͼe">&lt;!-- FINAL --&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;section&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"container final"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"small"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>The End</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;h2&gt;</span><span>Happy Boyfriend's Day, Yuvraj 💙</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/h2&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;p&gt;</span><span>

You aren't just a name on a screen.

You're a collection of memories,
laughs, conversations, little fights,
random moments and everything that makes
our story ours.

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</span><span>

I don't know what every tomorrow will look like.

But today?

I'm really glad it's you.

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;strong&gt;</span><span>
Happy Boyfriend's Day, Yuvraj.
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/strong&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</span><span>

From your very own Kishmish. 🫶

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/section&gt;</span><span>


</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;button</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"music"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">onclick</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"</span><span class="ͼm">toggleMusic</span><span>()</span><span class="ͼk">"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">id</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"musicBtn"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>
♪ 
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/button&gt;</span><span>


</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;script&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼe">/* STARS */</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼg">const</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">stars</span><span> </span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">document</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>getElementById(</span><span class="ͼk">"stars"</span><span>);

</span><span class="ͼg">for</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼg">let</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">i</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span>;</span><span class="ͼm">i</span><span class="ͼg">&lt;</span><span class="ͼj">120</span><span>;</span><span class="ͼm">i</span><span class="ͼg">++</span><span>){

    </span><span class="ͼg">const</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">star</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼm">document</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>createElement(</span><span class="ͼk">"div"</span><span>);

    </span><span class="ͼm">star</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>className</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"star"</span><span>;

    </span><span class="ͼm">star</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>style</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>left</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼm">Math</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>random()</span><span class="ͼg">*</span><span class="ͼj">100</span><span class="ͼg">+</span><span class="ͼk">"%"</span><span>;
    </span><span class="ͼm">star</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>style</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>top</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼm">Math</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>random()</span><span class="ͼg">*</span><span class="ͼj">100</span><span class="ͼg">+</span><span class="ͼk">"%"</span><span>;

    </span><span class="ͼm">star</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>style</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>animationDelay</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼm">Math</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>random()</span><span class="ͼg">*</span><span class="ͼj">2</span><span class="ͼg">+</span><span class="ͼk">"s"</span><span>;

    </span><span class="ͼm">stars</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>appendChild(</span><span class="ͼm">star</span><span>);
}


</span><span class="ͼe">/* START */</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼg">function</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">startExperience</span><span>(){

    </span><span class="ͼm">document</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>getElementById(</span><span class="ͼk">"message"</span><span>)
    </span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>scrollIntoView({behavior:</span><span class="ͼk">"smooth"</span><span>});

    </span><span class="ͼm">createHearts</span><span>();
}


</span><span class="ͼe">/* YES ANSWER */</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼg">function</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">answerYes</span><span>(){

    </span><span class="ͼg">const</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">answer</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼm">document</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>getElementById(</span><span class="ͼk">"answer"</span><span>);

    </span><span class="ͼm">answer</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>innerHTML</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span>
    </span><span class="ͼk">"Correct answer. 😌💙&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Now come here, idiot. 🫶"</span><span>;

    </span><span class="ͼm">createHearts</span><span>();
}


</span><span class="ͼe">/* GIFT */</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼg">function</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">openGift</span><span>(){

    </span><span class="ͼg">const</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">message</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼm">document</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>getElementById(</span><span class="ͼk">"giftMessage"</span><span>);

    </span><span class="ͼm">message</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>style</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>display</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"block"</span><span>;

    </span><span class="ͼm">document</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>querySelector(</span><span class="ͼk">".gift"</span><span>)</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>innerHTML</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"💙"</span><span>;

    </span><span class="ͼm">createHearts</span><span>();

}


</span><span class="ͼe">/* HEARTS */</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼg">function</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">createHearts</span><span>(){

    </span><span class="ͼg">for</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼg">let</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">i</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼj">0</span><span>;</span><span class="ͼm">i</span><span class="ͼg">&lt;</span><span class="ͼj">15</span><span>;</span><span class="ͼm">i</span><span class="ͼg">++</span><span>){

        </span><span class="ͼm">setTimeout</span><span>(()=&gt;{

            </span><span class="ͼg">const</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">heart</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼm">document</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>createElement(</span><span class="ͼk">"div"</span><span>);

            </span><span class="ͼm">heart</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>className</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"heart"</span><span>;

            </span><span class="ͼm">heart</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>innerHTML</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span>[</span><span class="ͼk">"💙"</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼk">"🤍"</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼk">"✨"</span><span>,</span><span class="ͼk">"🫶"</span><span>][</span><span class="ͼm">Math</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>floor(</span><span class="ͼm">Math</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>random()</span><span class="ͼg">*</span><span class="ͼj">4</span><span>)];

            </span><span class="ͼm">heart</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>style</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>left</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼm">Math</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>random()</span><span class="ͼg">*</span><span class="ͼj">100</span><span class="ͼg">+</span><span class="ͼk">"%"</span><span>;

            </span><span class="ͼm">heart</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>style</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>fontSize</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">15</span><span class="ͼg">+</span><span class="ͼm">Math</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>random()</span><span class="ͼg">*</span><span class="ͼj">25</span><span>)</span><span class="ͼg">+</span><span class="ͼk">"px"</span><span>;

            </span><span class="ͼm">heart</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>style</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>animationDuration</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼj">3</span><span class="ͼg">+</span><span class="ͼm">Math</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>random()</span><span class="ͼg">*</span><span class="ͼj">3</span><span>)</span><span class="ͼg">+</span><span class="ͼk">"s"</span><span>;

            </span><span class="ͼm">document</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>body</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>appendChild(</span><span class="ͼm">heart</span><span>);

            </span><span class="ͼm">setTimeout</span><span>(()=&gt;{
                </span><span class="ͼm">heart</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>remove();
            },</span><span class="ͼj">6000</span><span>);

        },</span><span class="ͼm">i</span><span class="ͼg">*</span><span class="ͼj">150</span><span>);
    }
}


</span><span class="ͼe">/* MUSIC */</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼg">let</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">playing</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼj">false</span><span>;

</span><span class="ͼg">function</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">toggleMusic</span><span>(){

    </span><span class="ͼg">const</span><span> </span><span class="ͼm">btn</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼm">document</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>getElementById(</span><span class="ͼk">"musicBtn"</span><span>);

    </span><span class="ͼg">if</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼg">!</span><span class="ͼm">playing</span><span>){

        </span><span class="ͼm">btn</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>innerHTML</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"🔊"</span><span>;

        </span><span class="ͼm">alert</span><span>(
        </span><span class="ͼk">"To add your song: put an MP3 file in this folder and connect it with an &lt;audio&gt; tag."</span><span>
        );

        </span><span class="ͼm">playing</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼj">true</span><span>;

    }</span><span class="ͼg">else</span><span>{

        </span><span class="ͼm">btn</span><span class="ͼg">.</span><span>innerHTML</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"♪"</span><span>;

        </span><span class="ͼm">playing</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼj">false</span><span>;

    }
}

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/script&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/body&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/html&gt;</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<h3 data-section-id="2urchb" dir="auto" data-start="11703" data-end="11729">Step 2 — Make it yours</h3>
<p dir="auto" data-start="11731" data-end="11781">There are <strong data-start="11741" data-end="11780">3 places I'd definitely personalize</strong>:</p>
<ol data-start="11783" data-end="12065">
<li data-section-id="12xbhh3" data-start="11783" data-end="11873">
<p dir="auto" data-start="11786" data-end="11873"><strong data-start="11786" data-end="11802">“Your Voice”</strong> → keep the singing reference because that's specifically about Yuvraj.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1t046lx" data-start="11874" data-end="11930">
<p dir="auto" data-start="11877" data-end="11930"><strong data-start="11877" data-end="11910">“From your very own Kishmish”</strong> → already included.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1om21xv" data-start="11931" data-end="12065">
<p dir="auto" data-start="11934" data-end="12065">Add an inside joke or one line that <strong data-start="11970" data-end="11997">only he will understand</strong>. That will make it feel much more personal than a generic template.</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p dir="auto" data-start="12067" data-end="12190" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">And this time, I deliberately <strong data-start="12097" data-end="12158">didn't use the old “Yes/No button that runs away” concept</strong> — the interaction is different.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div aria-label="Response actions" class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none -mt-1 touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto cant-hover:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" role="group" tabindex="-1" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button type="button" class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-surface-hover rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy response" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><div class="[&amp;_svg]:h-full [&amp;_svg]:w-full icon icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" focusable="false" aria-hidden="true"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M15.1006 1.78516C16.793 1.78556 18.165 3.15808 18.165 4.85059V10.8838C18.1649 12.5762 16.7929 13.9478 15.1006 13.9482H13.998V15.0508C13.9976 16.7431 12.626 18.1151 10.9336 18.1152H4.90039C3.20789 18.1152 1.83537 16.7432 1.83496 15.0508V9.01758C1.83496 7.32482 3.20764 5.95215 4.90039 5.95215H6.00195V4.85059C6.00195 3.15783 7.37463 1.78