v><span class="sr-only"><br></span></section></div><div class="" data-turn-id-container="e946514a-f807-4357-b3a2-10d3b78bd11b" data-is-intersecting="true" style="--last-known-height: 350px;" data-aria-hidden="true" aria-hidden="true"><section class="text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]" dir="auto" data-turn-id="e946514a-f807-4357-b3a2-10d3b78bd11b" data-turn-id-container="e946514a-f807-4357-b3a2-10d3b78bd11b" data-testid="conversation-turn-4" data-turn="assistant"><h4 class="sr-only select-none">ChatGPT said:</h4><div class="text-base my-auto mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div data-conversation-screenshot-content="" class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 [&amp;&gt;div:has([data-free-thinking-preview-answer=true])+:is(.text-message,.relative:has(&gt;.text-message))]:-mt-2 grow"><div class="TzNmiG_container gap-4 [&amp;&gt;div:has([data-free-thinking-preview-answer=true])+:is(.text-message,.relative:has(&gt;.text-message))]:-mt-2" data-streaming-response-group=""><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="e946514a-f807-4357-b3a2-10d3b78bd11b" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="LR5Y_W_content markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling"><p dir="auto" data-start="0" data-end="63">Yes — and photos would make this version much more personal. 💙</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="65" data-end="164">I’d suggest <strong data-start="77" data-end="122">not just putting them in a normal gallery</strong>. We can make them part of the experience:</p>
<ul data-start="166" data-end="495">
<li data-section-id="gb0w0a" data-start="166" data-end="238">
<p dir="auto" data-start="168" data-end="238">🖼️ <strong data-start="172" data-end="196">“Our little moments”</strong> — 4–8 photos in a stylish polaroid layout</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1m2g0wh" data-start="239" data-end="282">
<p dir="auto" data-start="241" data-end="282">💫 Photos appear one-by-one as you scroll</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="13hown2" data-start="283" data-end="320">
<p dir="auto" data-start="285" data-end="320">📝 A short caption under each photo</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1y6ntmy" data-start="321" data-end="385">
<p dir="auto" data-start="323" data-end="385">🔐 One <strong data-start="330" data-end="348">“secret photo”</strong> that appears after clicking a button</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="ohu50o" data-start="386" data-end="463">
<p dir="auto" data-start="388" data-end="463">❤️ Final section with your favorite photo + “Happy Boyfriend’s Day, Yuvraj”</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="a0a6r9" data-start="464" data-end="495">
<p dir="auto" data-start="466" data-end="495">📱 Fully responsive for phone</p>
</li>
</ul>
