ex flex-wrap gap-2"></div><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="0bbdc9ce-f1d0-41ac-a125-ee7f0b8c5727" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="LR5Y_W_content markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling"><p dir="auto" data-start="0" data-end="98">Done 💙 I made the <strong data-start="19" data-end="97">updated Yuvraj Boyfriend’s Day website with all 4 photos already connected</strong>.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="100" data-end="188"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button class="behavior-btn hover:entity-accent focus-visible:focus-ring entity-underline inline cursor-pointer appearance-none border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-start align-baseline text-inherit" type="button">Download the complete website ZIP</button></span></p>
<h3 data-section-id="12gt45x" dir="auto" data-start="190" data-end="213">To put it on GitHub</h3>
<ol data-start="214" data-end="517">
<li data-section-id="bfxvrs" data-start="214" data-end="242">
<p dir="auto" data-start="217" data-end="242">Download/extract the ZIP.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="15obsh2" data-start="243" data-end="283">
<p dir="auto" data-start="246" data-end="283">Open your existing GitHub repository.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1rkopql" data-start="284" data-end="342">
<p dir="auto" data-start="287" data-end="342">Upload <strong data-start="294" data-end="332"><code data-start="296" data-end="308">index.html</code> + all 4 <code data-start="317" data-end="324">photo</code> files</strong> together.</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="8da1d2" data-start="343" data-end="447">
<p dir="auto" data-start="346" data-end="375">Make sure the filenames stay:</p>
<ul data-start="379" data-end="447">
<li data-section-id="1vmhjmu" data-start="379" data-end="393">
<p dir="auto" data-start="381" data-end="393"><code data-start="381" data-end="393">photo1.jpg</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1xg71l1" data-start="397" data-end="411">
<p dir="auto" data-start="399" data-end="411"><code data-start="399" data-end="411">photo2.jpg</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1wu9kv8" data-start="415" data-end="429">
<p dir="auto" data-start="417" data-end="429"><code data-start="417" data-end="429">photo3.jpg</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="1tsv4eb" data-start="433" data-end="447">
<p dir="auto" data-start="435" data-end="447"><code data-start="435" data-end="447">photo4.jpg</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li data-section-id="12721kv" data-start="448" data-end="517">
<p dir="auto" data-start="451" data-end="517">Your GitHub Pages site will then display the photos automatically.</p>
</li>
</ol>
