<p dir="auto" data-start="38" data-end="268">One important thing: because the photos are separate image files, after pasting this code into <code data-start="133" data-end="145">index.html</code>, upload the <strong data-start="158" data-end="196">4 photos in the same GitHub folder</strong> and rename them <code data-start="213" data-end="225">photo1.jpg</code>, <code data-start="227" data-end="239">photo2.jpg</code>, <code data-start="241" data-end="253">photo3.jpg</code>, <code data-start="255" data-end="267">photo4.jpg</code>.</p>
