 ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span class="ͼf">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</span><span>
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;html</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">lang</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"en"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>
