</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"small"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>
05 / One last surprise
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;h2</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"title"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>
Open it yourself.
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/h2&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;p</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"subtitle"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>
Because apparently even a website
needs a little suspense.
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/p&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"question-box"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"gift"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">id</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"gift"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">onclick</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"</span><span class="ͼm">openGift</span><span>()</span><span class="ͼk">"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>
🎁
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;div</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">class</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"secret"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼn">id</span><span class="ͼg">=</span><span class="ͼk">"secret"</span><span class="ͼo">&gt;</span><span>

Okay, Yuvraj...

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</span><span>

If this whole website could give you
one thing, it would be a reminder that
somewhere in this huge world,
there is someone who is genuinely happy
that you exist.

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;strong&gt;</span><span>
I love youuuu. 💙
</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/strong&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</span><span>

— Your Kishmish 🫶

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

</span><span class="ͼo">&lt;/div&gt;</span><span>

