<p dir="auto" data-start="36" data-end="95">Now go back to your <strong data-start="56" data-end="83"><code data-start="58" data-end="81">yuvraj-boyfriends-day</code></strong> repository.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="obb7sd" dir="auto" data-start="97" data-end="110">1. Click:</h3>
<p dir="auto" data-start="111" data-end="138"><strong data-start="111" data-end="138">Add file → Upload files</strong></p>
<h3 data-section-id="1vcasj1" dir="auto" data-start="140" data-end="168">2. Upload your 4 photos.</h3>
<p dir="auto" data-start="170" data-end="208">Before uploading, rename them exactly:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="210" data-end="265"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6bbe06e6.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>photo1.jpg
photo2.jpg
photo3.jpg
photo4.jpg</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p dir="auto" data-start="267" data-end="270">So:</p>
<ul data-start="272" data-end="389">
<li data-section-id="1ltxnxe" data-start="272" data-end="300">
<p dir="auto" data-start="274" data-end="300">First photo → <code data-start="288" data-end="300">photo1.jpg</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="27w8x7" data-start="301" data-end="330">
<p dir="auto" data-start="303" data-end="330">Second photo → <code data-start="318" data-end="330">photo2.jpg</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="q2dswp" data-start="331" data-end="359">
<p dir="auto" data-start="333" data-end="359">Third photo → <code data-start="347" data-end="359">photo3.jpg</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="16vs5u7" data-start="360" data-end="389">
<p dir="auto" data-start="362" data-end="389">Fourth photo → <code data-start="377" data-end="389">photo4.jpg</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<h3 data-section-id="ndlwrs" dir="auto" data-start="391" data-end="436">3. After all 4 are selected, scroll down.</h3>
<p dir="auto" data-start="438" data-end="468">You'll see <strong data-start="449" data-end="467">Commit changes</strong>.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="470" data-end="476">Click:</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="478" data-end="496"><strong data-start="478" data-end="496">Commit changes</strong></p>
<h3 data-section-id="1cphyv0" dir="auto" data-start="498" data-end="539">Your repository should now look like:</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="541" data-end="666"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6bbe06e6.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>📁 yuvraj-boyfriends-day
