<p dir="auto" data-start="668" data-end="812" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node=""><strong data-start="668" data-end="682">Stop here.</strong> Once you've uploaded them, say <strong data-start="714" data-end="724">“done”</strong> and I'll give you <strong data-start="743" data-end="812" data-is-last-node="">STEP 5 — making the website live and getting the link for Yuvraj.</strong></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="_r_k6_-panel-2" aria-hidden="true" aria-label="Option 2" class="invisible pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0" data-paragen-option="2" data-testid="paragen-option-2" role="region"><div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-3"><div><div class="pt-0"><div class="gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full"><div class="relative flex items-center justify-center h-6 w-6 shrink-0 rounded-xs bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary"><svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><text x="-9999" y="-9999">ChatGPT</text><path d="M9.20509 8.76511V6.50545C9.20509 6.31513 9.27649 6.17234 9.44293 6.0773L13.9861 3.46088C14.6046 3.10413 15.342 2.93769 16.103 2.93769C18.9573 2.93769 20.7651 5.14983 20.7651 7.50454C20.7651 7.67098 20.7651 7.86129 20.7412 8.05161L16.0316 5.2924C15.7462 5.12596 15.4607 5.12596 15.1753 5.2924L9.20509 8.76511ZM19.8135 17.5659V12.1664C19.8135 11.8333 19.6708 11.5955 19.3854 11.429L13.4152 7.95633L15.3656 6.83833C15.5321 6.74328 15.6749 6.74328 15.8413 6.83833L20.3845 9.45474C21.6928 10.216 22.5728 11.8333 22.5728 13.4031C22.5728 15.2108 21.5025 16.8758 19.8135 17.5657V17.5659ZM7.80173 12.8088L5.8513 11.6671C5.68486 11.5721 5.61346 11.4293 5.61346 11.239V6.00613C5.61346 3.46111 7.56389 1.53433 10.2042 1.53433C11.2033 1.53433 12.1307 1.86743 12.9159 2.46202L8.2301 5.17371C7.94475 5.34015 7.80195 5.57798 7.80195 5.91109V12.809L7.80173 12.8088ZM12 15.2349L9.20509 13.6651V10.3351L12 8.76534L14.7947 10.335