lative:has(&gt;.text-message))]:-mt-2" data-streaming-response-group=""><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="8645ebec-c5c7-467e-ab18-ea5255c4fcc9" data-markdown-talvt-message-id="8645ebec-c5c7-467e-ab18-ea5255c4fcc9" data-markdown-talvt-render-state="ready" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-6" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="LR5Y_W_content markdown prose dark:prose-invert wrap-break-word w-full light markdown-new-styling"><h2 data-section-id="1rkntib" dir="auto" data-start="0" data-end="34">STEP 4 — Upload the 4 photos 📸</h2>
<p dir="auto" data-start="36" data-end="95">Now go back to the <strong data-start="55" data-end="94">main page of your GitHub repository</strong>.</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="97" data-end="125">You should see <code data-start="112" data-end="124">index.html</code>.</p>
<h3 data-section-id="153dtv4" dir="auto" data-start="127" data-end="152"><span role="text">1. Click <strong data-start="140" data-end="152">Add file</strong></span></h3>
<h3 data-section-id="1mzek1u" dir="auto" data-start="154" data-end="183"><span role="text">2. Click <strong data-start="167" data-end="183">Upload files</strong></span></h3>
<h3 data-section-id="1vbjyef" dir="auto" data-start="185" data-end="232">3. Select your 4 photos from your computer.</h3>
<h3 data-section-id="1am2csj" dir="auto" data-start="234" data-end="283">4. IMPORTANT — rename them exactly like this:</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="285" data-end="340"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6bbe06e6.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>photo1.jpg
photo2.jpg
photo3.jpg
photo4.jpg</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p dir="auto" data-start="342" data-end="345">So:</p>
<ul data-start="347" data-end="464">
<li data-section-id="1ltxnxe" data-start="347" data-end="375">
<p dir="auto" data-start="349" data-end="375">First photo → <code data-start="363" data-end="375">photo1.jpg</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="27w8x7" data-start="376" data-end="405">
<p dir="auto" data-start="378" data-end="405">Second photo → <code data-start="393" data-end="405">photo2.jpg</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="q2dswp" data-start="406" data-end="434">
<p dir="auto" data-start="408" data-end="434">Third photo → <code data-start="422" data-end="434">photo3.jpg</code></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id="16vs5u7" data-start="435" data-end="464">
<p dir="auto" data-start="437" data-end="464">Fourth photo → <code data-start="452" data-end="464">photo4.jpg</code></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto" data-start="466" data-end="497"><strong data-start="466" data-end="497">Don't put them in a folder.</strong></p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="499" data-end="532">Your repository should look like:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="534" data-end="645"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-6bbe06e6.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼd ͼr"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>📁 yuvraj-boyfriends-day

📄 index.html
🖼️ photo1.jpg
🖼️ photo2.jpg
🖼️ photo3.jpg
🖼️ photo4.jpg</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<h3 data-section-id="f6927h" dir="auto" data-start="647" data-end="695"><span role="text">5. Scroll down and click <strong data-start="676" data-end="694">Commit changes</strong>.</span></h3>
<p dir="auto" data-start="697" data-end="722">That's <strong data-start="704" data-end="719">Step 4 done</strong>. ✅</p>
<p dir="auto" data-start="724" data-end="812" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Tell me <strong data-start="732" data-end="740">done</strong>, and I'll give you <strong data-start="760" data-end="811">Step 5 — make the website live and get the link</strong>.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" data-aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div data-conversation-screenshot-content="" class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 px-(--thread-content-margin)" data-aria-hidden="true" aria-hidden="true"><div></div></div></div></section></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)" data-aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="invisible mt-auto grid" data-aria-hidden="true" aria-hidden="true"><div class="col-start-1 row-start-1"><div class="pointer-events-none translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom) R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars min-h-(--gutter-remaining-height,0px) group-data-stream-active/scroll-root:h-[calc(var(--thread-response-height)-16*var(--spacing))]" style="--gutter-remaining-height: -429.73748779296875px;"></div></div><div class="visible sticky bottom-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px) col-start-1 row-start-1 min-w-0 self-end"><div class="text-base mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1"><div><div></div><div></div></div></div></div><div data-testid="thread-disclaimer" class="" style="height: auto; opacity: 1; transform: none;"><div class="